13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,210
Continuous Improvement

14
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,140
or as the Japanese call it:

15
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,220
Kaizen

16
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:31,030
That's what ISO 9001 requires in clause

17
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:31,940
10.3:

18
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,210
continual improvement…

19
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,550
